<h2>Animation knobs</h2>

<p>Under <c>animation</c> in <c>deck.json</c> (seconds):</p>

<ul>
  <li><c>move</c> — how long tokens glide to a new position</li>
  <li><c>fade</c> — fade in / out of tokens</li>
  <li><c>moveDelay</c> — moved tokens wait for the fade-out to finish</li>
  <li><c>fadeInDelay</c> — new tokens wait for the move to finish</li>
  <li><c>ease</c> — any CSS timing function</li>
  <li><c>slideFade</c> — background and text crossfade between slides</li>
  <li><c>textDrift</c> — pixels the text drifts while it fades (default 8; <c>0</c> for a pure fade); <c>textStagger</c> — delay between a slide's blocks (default 0.06)</li>
</ul>

<p>Users who prefer reduced motion get instant transitions automatically.</p>

<notes>
  Try move: 1.2 for a slow-motion demo.
</notes>
